  "scientific_limitations": [
    "All four scenarios originate from the same synthetic AIT-LDS v2.1 testbed; results are exploratory and do not establish external validity on production networks.",
    "Verified binary labels come from one intranet-server Apache log per scenario; host/service effects cannot be separated from scenario effects.",
    "Unknown-labelled records (617,876 / 42.0%) are excluded from supervised training and evaluation and are never treated as normal.",
    "Class imbalance is severe and heterogeneous across scenarios (4.67:1 to 197.42:1 attack:normal; 83.84:1 overall), with high-volume dirb scans dominating event counts.",
    "Identical attack-category vocabularies and repeated feature-vector fingerprints across scenarios indicate shared simulation patterns.",
